00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.440
The defending series champion has won twice, but has only one other finish in the top 15.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.540
No one has been immune from this up-and-down ride in 98.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:23.910
Every driver with a top-three finish has also placed 23rd or lower.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.980
Consistency has always been the key to winning the championship, but so far, no one has been...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.100
